error[E0473]: 'using' cannot carry the returned 'Result<int32[]>' through its close
  --> $DIR/using-generic-array-result.nra:15:5
   |
14 | let read = func<T>(make: func() -> T) -> Result<T> {
   | ----------------------------------------------------... 'read<int32[]>' returns 'Result<int32[]>' with the type arguments it is called with
15 |     using (source = new Resource()) {
   |     ^^^^^
   |
   = note: a return inside 'using' passes its value to the close, which may replace it with the close error
   = help: return a list, which the result can hold, or close the resource before building the array

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0473`.
